.TH "GF-ORGS-UPDATE-ORG-USER" "1" "Jun 2026" "" ""

.SH NAME
gf-orgs-update-org-user - Updates users in organization


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgf orgs update-org-user [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Updates users in organization

.PP
If you are running Grafana Enterprise and have Fine-grained access control enabled you need to have a permission with action: \fBorg.users.role:update\fR with scope \fBusers:*\fR\&.

.PP
Body schema (UpdateOrgUserCommand):
  role  string  enum: None | Viewer | Editor | Admin

.PP
Response schema (UpdateOrgUserOK.Payload):
  message  string


.SH OPTIONS
